  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Spotlight Initiative 2.0 Liberia (Outcome A), Laws, policies, institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Liberia Spotlight Initiative 2.0 Programme adopts a comprehensive, multi-sectoral approach to reduce sexual and gender-based violence (SGBV) and harmful practices, while promoting gender equality and women&#x2019;s empowerment (GEWE). Building on the achievements and lessons from Spotlight 1.0, the programme strengthens Liberia&#x2019;s legislative and institutional frameworks, with particular focus on the criminalization of female genital mutilation (FGM), enforcement of domestic violence and rape laws,</narrative>
  </description>
